Association: Oromia Tourism & Hospitality Professionals Association (OHPEA). Based in Oromia region, Ethiopia. Languages: Afaan Oromo (om), English (en), Amharic (am), Arabic (ar), French (fr). Content fields that are shown publicly are stored as JSONB { "en": "...", "om": "...", "am": "...", "ar": "...", "fr": "..." } with en required and a fallback to en when a language is missing.

Member registration fields (from the client interview):

Full name, phone (normalize to +2519XXXXXXXX / +2517XXXXXXXX), email, gender (male/female), date of birth (optional)
Graduation level: diploma, first_degree (1st), second_degree (2nd), third_degree (3rd). Make this a lookup, not a hard-coded enum in SQL.
Current occupation sector type: private, government, other
Business/professional sector (lookup): hotel, restaurant, lodge/resort, tour operator, travel agency, cafe, catering, training institution/college, tourism bureau/government office, other (admin-editable)
